      "summary_en": "Orianna commands her Ball to fire toward a target location, dealing magic damage to targets along the way (deals less damage to subsequent targets). Her Ball remains at the target location after.",
      "summary_zh": "奥莉安娜指挥她的魔偶，朝目标区域发射，对沿途目标造成魔法伤害（对后续目标伤害递减）。指令结束后魔偶会停在目标区域。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309187:3995779"
      ]
